Recommends: systemd
Description: Control and monitor the fans of an ASUS Vivobook laptop
 Reads the asus hwmon device exposed by the M7400QE (and similar Vivobook
 models) and lets you switch each fan between firmware automatic control and
 full speed.
 .
 Ships both a Qt 6 graphical window with live RPM, temperatures, history
 graphs and a tray menu, and a fanctl command line interface. Fan changes go
 through a polkit-authorized root helper, so no world-writable sysfs nodes or
 sudo rules are needed. Optionally the chosen modes are re-applied at boot.
